# Wealth inequality for white males and white females, 1990 -> 1996 (NLSY79 processed file)

Conventions: nominal dollars; composite wealth as documented; years as cross-sections of the
same nominal sample (no respondent ID); full-row duplicates retained as ties; Gini on the FULL
group with negatives truncated to zero (zeros kept), identical convention both years
(positive-subsample Gini as sensitivity); top shares = share of aggregate POSITIVE wealth held
by the top 10%/1% of the group; ratios and proportional changes "undefined" when base <= 0.

